Amiberry (Amiga): save in the active profile's folder instead of the shared /userdata/saves/amiga.

batoceraPaths.SAVES follows the active profile; the Amiga generator ignored it and wrote to a fixed path, so every profile shared (and
overwrote) the same Amiga saves.  The first time the DEFAULT profile plays after this change, the old shared saves are copied into its
folder (the originals are never touched); a named profile starts empty.
diff --git a/configgen/generators/amiberry/amiberryGenerator.py b/configgen/generators/amiberry/amiberryGenerator.py
